      "description": "现有中号主按钮；通过项目变量响应浅色、深色与按下状态。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-primary\">阅读 Go 指南</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{font-family:var(--claude-ui-font,'Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif);letter-spacing:0;display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--vp-button-brand-border,#b45335);border-radius:20px;padding:0 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:38px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;color:var(--vp-button-brand-text,#fff);background:var(--vp-button-brand-bg,#b45335);transition:color 0.25s,border-color 0.25s,background-color 0.25s;}.ds-button-primary:hover{color:var(--vp-button-brand-hover-text,#fff);background:var(--vp-button-brand-hover-bg,#ae5133);border-color:var(--vp-button-brand-hover-border,#ae5133);}.ds-button-primary:active{color:var(--vp-button-brand-active-text,#fff);background:var(--vp-button-brand-active-bg,#9d482d);border-color:var(--vp-button-brand-active-border,#9d482d);transition-duration:0.1s;}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--claude-link,#184f95);outline-offset:2px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:host *,:host *::before,:host *::after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;}}"
